WEBVTT

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:11.792
♪ When, oh, when will that bird ♪

00:00:11.792 --> 00:00:15.958
♪ come out from its cage? ♪

00:00:15.958 --> 00:00:18.125
♪ The crane and the turtle slipped ♪

00:00:18.125 --> 00:00:19.833
♪ in the morning twilight ♪

00:00:19.833 --> 00:00:23.458
♪ Who is behind you? ♪

00:00:23.458 --> 00:00:26.125
Toshi! Kae! Hitomi!

00:00:26.125 --> 00:00:28.625
Aww, no fair, Hiyu!

00:00:28.625 --> 00:00:30.917
This is boring...

00:00:30.917 --> 00:00:32.958
Hiyu always gets it right!

00:00:32.958 --> 00:00:35.417
It's like he's got eyes in the back of his head!

00:00:35.417 --> 00:00:36.833
Creepy!

00:00:36.833 --> 00:00:38.792
I'm not playing anymore!

00:00:38.792 --> 00:00:40.458
Let's go!

00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:43.583
Um...

00:00:45.375 --> 00:00:47.292
You're Tatsuma Hiyu, aren't you?

00:00:47.292 --> 00:00:50.125
Uh, yeah...

00:00:50.125 --> 00:00:52.292
Who are you?

00:00:57.792 --> 00:00:59.958
<i>Time to die!</i>

00:01:02.125 --> 00:01:04.958
<i>The perfect world!</i>

00:01:04.958 --> 00:01:12.458
<i>We exchanged promises...</i>

00:01:12.458 --> 00:01:15.125
<i>Let's break the spine!</i>

00:01:15.125 --> 00:01:19.958
<i>...under the moonlight</i>

00:01:19.958 --> 00:01:24.833
<i>At midnight, whispering like a roar</i>

00:01:24.833 --> 00:01:30.292
<i>In the silence and bustle of your current situation</i>

00:01:30.292 --> 00:01:35.417
<i>Do you feel like you're gonna go crazy and break?</i>

00:01:35.417 --> 00:01:39.208
<i>But live your own way, yeah, like you are</i>

00:01:39.208 --> 00:01:43.250
<i>That perfect world!</i>

00:01:43.250 --> 00:01:48.458
<i>Let's not be chameleons</i>

00:01:48.458 --> 00:01:53.583
<i>But change ourselves from the inside</i>

00:01:53.583 --> 00:01:57.292
<i>I can hear those words</i>

00:01:57.292 --> 00:02:03.792
<i>Let's shout out so that the</i>
<i>dawn will break all nights</i>

00:02:03.792 --> 00:02:07.583
<i>Gently and furiously</i>

00:02:07.583 --> 00:02:19.125
<i>Let's shout out so that the</i>
<i>dawn will rip apart all nights</i>

00:02:23.958 --> 00:02:25.917
"Magami Academy"

00:02:25.958 --> 00:02:29.000
And so the seniors will be taking
the long-awaited entrance exams.

00:02:29.000 --> 00:02:32.375
The student council president will
soon be stepping down from her post,

00:02:32.375 --> 00:02:35.125
but please share your thoughts on
the upcoming officers for next term!

00:02:35.125 --> 00:02:41.125
Yes! Well, they are all committed to
making our school an even better place, and...

00:02:41.125 --> 00:02:43.083
No laughing, you!

00:02:43.083 --> 00:02:44.750
I guess since you're here,

00:02:44.750 --> 00:02:47.208
I'll also be having an interview with
the captain of the archery team!

00:02:47.208 --> 00:02:51.792
Huh?! You didn't say anything about that!

00:02:51.792 --> 00:02:55.792
Looks like Sakurai's doing all right. That's a relief.

00:02:55.792 --> 00:02:58.000
Out for a little daytime peeping?

00:03:01.958 --> 00:03:03.792
What do you think you're doing, ya damn pervert?!

00:03:03.792 --> 00:03:08.458
I... I'm sorry! It's not what you think!

00:03:08.458 --> 00:03:11.833
Sakurai's very tense, isn't she?

00:03:11.833 --> 00:03:14.875
I'm worried about the other one too.

00:03:18.583 --> 00:03:19.542
Afternoon.

00:03:19.542 --> 00:03:22.042
Ah, Captain Sakurai!

00:03:22.042 --> 00:03:24.333
So, is this the last time we
can call you "captain" then?

00:03:24.333 --> 00:03:27.250
That's right, you'll be retiring
from your position soon.

00:03:27.250 --> 00:03:32.250
Good grief, now I'll get out
of shape, retiring and all.

00:03:52.208 --> 00:03:55.333
If I ever lost the ability to draw my bow...

00:04:22.125 --> 00:04:23.625
"Dark Arts Chapter"

00:04:23.625 --> 00:04:24.792
"Dark Arts Chapter"
"Ninth Night"

00:04:24.792 --> 00:04:26.625
"Gently and Furiously"

00:04:26.625 --> 00:04:29.917
"Nurse's Office"

00:04:32.875 --> 00:04:36.875
What... What the heck is wrong with me?

00:04:38.917 --> 00:04:41.667
It's all right. It'll be all right.

00:04:41.667 --> 00:04:43.750
This is just a temporary thing.

00:04:43.750 --> 00:04:46.417
Just calm down, and I'm sure
you'll be back to normal soon.

00:05:10.500 --> 00:05:11.958
Mother...

00:05:14.208 --> 00:05:16.792
Mother!

00:05:23.125 --> 00:05:24.125
What's this now?

00:05:24.125 --> 00:05:25.375
Get lost.

00:05:25.375 --> 00:05:26.792
Mother?

00:05:28.125 --> 00:05:29.875
Oh, Mother!

00:05:33.917 --> 00:05:34.958
What do you want?

00:05:34.958 --> 00:05:38.500
We have seen a sign of one of the treasures.

00:05:42.083 --> 00:05:47.125
Go find it. It must be here
somewhere, here in Tokyo.

00:05:49.000 --> 00:05:55.083
Listen, Hisui, it is about
time that you also learned

00:05:55.083 --> 00:06:00.167
of our family's other mission, which we uphold!

00:06:01.542 --> 00:06:02.958
What do you think about that?

00:06:02.958 --> 00:06:04.958
We call them "juvenile crimes,"

00:06:04.958 --> 00:06:07.792
but this problem doesn't concern only children.

00:06:07.792 --> 00:06:09.792
We have children killing their
parents and killing other children;

00:06:09.792 --> 00:06:11.958
we've got adults who can't seem to grow up,

00:06:11.958 --> 00:06:15.208
and a society and regime that
fosters these kinds of people!

00:06:15.208 --> 00:06:19.125
That's why we propose a government that will
stay closely in tune with the local communities.

00:06:37.458 --> 00:06:38.750
How's it look on your end?

00:06:38.750 --> 00:06:40.875
Nothing out of the ordinary.
How about with Misato?

00:06:40.875 --> 00:06:44.417
Haven't seen her.
Maybe she's still over that way.

00:06:44.417 --> 00:06:48.000
Let's go. I'll bet she's in trouble.

00:06:48.000 --> 00:06:49.167
Yeah...

00:07:10.958 --> 00:07:12.458
Are you all right?

00:07:22.667 --> 00:07:25.000
Hey, are you all right?!

00:07:26.625 --> 00:07:30.833
It was nothing, just some girl getting groped.

00:07:33.542 --> 00:07:37.542
This town sure is carefree, despite all the
messed up things that have been going on.

00:07:37.542 --> 00:07:38.875
It can't be helped.

00:07:38.875 --> 00:07:42.458
After all, no one has any idea
that demons are behind those things.

00:07:42.458 --> 00:07:45.917
What now? Shall we continue
our patrol a little longer?

00:07:48.583 --> 00:07:50.042
You sonnuva bitch!

00:07:57.958 --> 00:08:00.208
They aren't demons?

00:08:01.167 --> 00:08:03.750
Damn... Damn it!

00:08:03.750 --> 00:08:05.625
Man, oh man...

00:08:08.792 --> 00:08:10.458
I can't blame her.

00:08:10.458 --> 00:08:14.917
Not after seeing someone
she used to know end up like that...

00:08:14.917 --> 00:08:19.167
That doesn't mean we can waste our time
coddling someone who can't fight.

00:08:19.167 --> 00:08:22.458
Guess the one I most want
to say that to ain't here though.

00:08:31.167 --> 00:08:33.792
Captain! I have located Private Daigo!

00:08:33.792 --> 00:08:38.458
He's presently holed up in the Home Ec. room.

00:08:38.458 --> 00:08:40.500
Ooh, scrumptious!

00:09:00.292 --> 00:09:01.917
Sakurai?

00:09:04.833 --> 00:09:08.917
It's no use. Why can't I draw my bow?

00:09:10.625 --> 00:09:13.167
Um, Sakurai...

00:09:13.167 --> 00:09:18.542
I... I made you lunch. Please have it.

00:09:29.583 --> 00:09:32.208
Insensitive dolt!

00:09:48.083 --> 00:09:50.542
Wh-What the hell is this?!

00:09:50.542 --> 00:09:52.833
I sense an oppressive aura.

00:09:52.833 --> 00:09:54.792
I don't think there's any way it's human.

00:10:06.333 --> 00:10:07.875
A girl?!

00:10:07.875 --> 00:10:09.000
But...

00:10:11.542 --> 00:10:13.958
Hey, you! Stay right there!

00:10:13.958 --> 00:10:15.375
W-Wait!

00:10:15.375 --> 00:10:17.792
Huh? Are you crazy?!

00:10:17.792 --> 00:10:21.042
Look at what she just did!
We can't let her go after that!

00:10:21.042 --> 00:10:22.042
But...

00:10:22.042 --> 00:10:25.458
We'll think about it later.
Right now, we've gotta stop her!

00:10:37.583 --> 00:10:39.250
Master...

00:10:42.625 --> 00:10:44.667
Look, you...

00:10:44.667 --> 00:10:46.167
I'm sorry.

00:10:46.167 --> 00:10:47.458
Man, oh man...

00:10:47.458 --> 00:10:49.833
Y-You're heavy, Kyouichi.

00:10:49.833 --> 00:10:51.417
Shaddup.

00:10:54.917 --> 00:11:02.083
Master, you saved me, but I'm no good.

00:11:02.083 --> 00:11:05.292
I can't save others.

00:11:05.292 --> 00:11:09.417
I can't even save the girl I love.

00:11:10.708 --> 00:11:14.125
I want to protect those who are dear to me.

00:11:15.583 --> 00:11:20.208
Please tell me what I should do.

00:11:42.792 --> 00:11:45.167
Cripes, you've gotta be kidding me!

00:11:45.167 --> 00:11:49.750
It's not just Komaki anymore.
Now the musclehead and Aoi are no use either!

00:11:49.750 --> 00:11:51.875
What do you intend to do?

00:11:51.875 --> 00:11:53.375
Like we got options?

00:11:53.375 --> 00:11:57.792
For now, the two of us will just
have to take out the demons on our own.

00:11:57.792 --> 00:11:59.292
Right?

00:11:59.292 --> 00:12:01.542
Well, I guess that is the only choice.

00:12:01.542 --> 00:12:03.792
I'm counting on you.

00:12:03.792 --> 00:12:06.625
By the way, how's that going?

00:12:06.625 --> 00:12:11.083
Have you found out where
that Kozunu bastard is?

00:12:11.083 --> 00:12:13.333
I'm still investigating.

00:12:15.833 --> 00:12:21.167
Hey, you're not still hiding
anything from us, are you?

00:12:21.167 --> 00:12:22.292
Not really.

00:12:22.292 --> 00:12:23.833
Don't distrust me.

00:12:29.292 --> 00:12:32.958
"Kisaragi Antiques"

00:12:32.958 --> 00:12:35.583
Hey, sorry, I just remembered
something I gotta go take care of.

00:12:35.583 --> 00:12:37.000
Oh, you too?

00:12:37.000 --> 00:12:42.208
No choice, I need to do what
a certain someone didn't have the balls to.

00:12:57.667 --> 00:13:00.333
Who's there?! Stop spying on me!

00:13:02.708 --> 00:13:05.625
Houraiji? What do you want?

00:13:09.792 --> 00:13:11.667
What the heck are you doing?!

00:13:29.958 --> 00:13:34.167
Stop the endless crying and moaning, she-male!

00:13:34.167 --> 00:13:36.458
You can't protect the princess.

00:13:36.458 --> 00:13:38.875
Don't take the prince on
a white horse thing too far either.

00:13:38.875 --> 00:13:40.708
What?!

00:13:42.958 --> 00:13:46.792
What's the matter?
Did you forget your balls in mommy's uterus?

00:13:46.792 --> 00:13:51.458
Oh, wait, you're a girl, huh?
Maybe I oughta put my moves down on--

00:13:54.833 --> 00:13:56.625
Don't screw with me!

00:13:58.208 --> 00:14:01.500
That's a heck of a slap you got.

00:14:04.625 --> 00:14:06.667
That'll do.

00:14:06.667 --> 00:14:10.417
Now relax, go back to being your old self.

00:14:28.208 --> 00:14:29.500
Hi...

00:14:34.125 --> 00:14:36.708
Talk to me, Misato.

00:14:56.750 --> 00:14:59.792
This is where it all started.

00:15:14.917 --> 00:15:16.792
So, this is where you were?

00:15:20.625 --> 00:15:25.375
I forgot something very important. I'm sorry.

00:15:27.583 --> 00:15:33.292
I didn't consider your feelings.

00:15:33.292 --> 00:15:38.458
Your favorite foods,
or what you really want to eat.

00:15:42.750 --> 00:15:44.792
What is this?

00:15:44.792 --> 00:15:50.917
Sakurai, what happened to you
the other day must have been difficult.

00:15:50.917 --> 00:15:56.417
Something like that could scar anyone, even me,

00:15:56.417 --> 00:16:00.292
but I know that you can overcome this.

00:16:00.292 --> 00:16:02.875
So, I want you to cheer up.

00:16:04.125 --> 00:16:07.792
I will protect you, Sakurai!

00:16:07.792 --> 00:16:12.667
So, please have no fear, and protect
whatever it is you want to protect!

00:16:14.167 --> 00:16:15.917
Daigo...

00:16:17.917 --> 00:16:20.875
"Komaki Sakurai's Favorite Things"

00:16:26.542 --> 00:16:28.458
Aoi...

00:16:28.458 --> 00:16:33.417
Help, Aoi! Help me...

00:16:33.417 --> 00:16:35.333
Aoi!

00:16:38.625 --> 00:16:40.250
It's unsightly, isn't it?

00:16:40.250 --> 00:16:44.500
But I would have endured a hundred times worse

00:16:44.500 --> 00:16:47.708
if I could have saved my friend back then.

00:16:47.708 --> 00:16:51.333
This is my stigma.

00:16:51.333 --> 00:16:59.500
I'm afraid... I'm terribly afraid
of people suffering or dying.

00:16:59.500 --> 00:17:03.333
I think about how terrifying
and painful it must have been

00:17:03.333 --> 00:17:07.583
for those people who were killed
by demons or who became demons.

00:17:07.583 --> 00:17:10.333
Those thoughts consume me,

00:17:10.333 --> 00:17:13.375
so much so that I feel like
I'm being crushed sometimes.

00:17:20.792 --> 00:17:23.333
I feel like I'm being pushed about

00:17:23.333 --> 00:17:27.292
by some sort of impossibly big forces
that I can't do anything about.

00:17:27.292 --> 00:17:30.792
I guess that's what we call fate, huh?

00:17:33.875 --> 00:17:36.000
Maybe.

00:17:39.667 --> 00:17:41.042
That's...

00:18:09.417 --> 00:18:10.917
Here.

00:18:27.958 --> 00:18:31.500
I've had this birthmark all my life.

00:18:31.500 --> 00:18:35.792
It made me seem different
from the other kids. I hated it.

00:18:35.792 --> 00:18:40.958
But my father told me it was
a symbol I'd need someday,

00:18:40.958 --> 00:18:43.458
and to take care of it.

00:18:43.458 --> 00:18:47.292
I finally understood what he
meant when I came to Magami.

00:18:47.292 --> 00:18:48.708
Fighting against the demons,

00:18:48.708 --> 00:18:52.000
I thought I had finally
realized my purpose in life.

00:18:52.000 --> 00:18:58.000
Even if that was my fate,
I'm glad that I was able to meet you all.

00:18:58.000 --> 00:19:03.458
So, let's face our fate without any fear,
even if we don't know where it might lead us.

00:19:26.292 --> 00:19:27.542
What the...

00:19:27.542 --> 00:19:29.792
That girl doesn't have any kind of aura.

00:19:29.792 --> 00:19:30.750
Huh?

00:19:41.958 --> 00:19:45.708
Seems she's going to be
more trouble than the last one.

00:19:45.708 --> 00:19:47.833
She's being engulfed by the energy.

00:20:00.208 --> 00:20:01.292
Stop doing this!

00:20:01.292 --> 00:20:04.375
Give it a rest!
You won't get through to her now!

00:20:04.375 --> 00:20:07.458
Your will is also being
swallowed by that energy!

00:20:14.125 --> 00:20:15.292
Here it comes!

00:20:21.542 --> 00:20:24.458
It's no use! I can't hold out much longer!

00:20:37.792 --> 00:20:39.083
Komaki!

00:20:43.375 --> 00:20:44.917
Sakurai!

00:20:44.917 --> 00:20:47.792
Thanks for the lunch box. It was good.

00:20:49.083 --> 00:20:50.292
Don't be distracted!

00:20:50.292 --> 00:20:51.458
She's back up.

00:21:10.042 --> 00:21:11.917
What a disaster.

00:21:11.917 --> 00:21:14.625
Did she use up all of her power?

00:21:17.917 --> 00:21:22.792
Is this how everyone with power ends up?

00:21:22.792 --> 00:21:27.458
But if you can stay in control
of yourself, I'm sure you'll be okay.

00:21:27.458 --> 00:21:30.250
Stop it, you can't save her now.

00:21:30.250 --> 00:21:32.042
Don't die!

00:21:32.042 --> 00:21:37.792
Live! Please, live! Live!

00:21:43.875 --> 00:21:45.792
A-Aoi!

00:22:01.750 --> 00:22:06.417
There she is! I found you, Bodhisattva Eye!

00:22:07.458 --> 00:22:09.708
"Kabukijo Police Department"

00:22:17.667 --> 00:22:18.958
"Missing Persons"

00:22:18.958 --> 00:22:20.583
"Sera Rikudou"

00:22:20.583 --> 00:22:25.292
It's totally amazing! I never
knew you had a power like that!

00:22:42.250 --> 00:22:47.375
<i>I sadly hung my head a bit</i>

00:22:47.375 --> 00:22:52.458
<i>And finally you murmured</i>

00:22:52.458 --> 00:22:56.708
<i>What I heard was a faint goodbye</i>

00:22:56.708 --> 00:23:01.625
<i>Said with all your might</i>

00:23:03.583 --> 00:23:12.917
<i>Our pulses echo in the awkward silence</i>

00:23:12.917 --> 00:23:14.792
<i>We can see each other again</i>

00:23:14.792 --> 00:23:17.250
<i>Let's meet up again some time</i>

00:23:17.250 --> 00:23:23.042
<i>Let's each set out in search of our own futures</i>

00:23:23.042 --> 00:23:27.583
<i>For the kindness you gave me for my heartache</i>

00:23:27.583 --> 00:23:32.000
<i>I thank you now</i>

00:23:33.167 --> 00:23:37.792
<i>These flower petals seem just as if</i>

00:23:37.792 --> 00:23:43.458
<i>They were blessing us as we depart on our journeys</i>

00:23:43.458 --> 00:23:47.875
<i>I won't forget your warmth</i>

00:23:47.875 --> 00:23:53.083
<i>That overwhelmed my loneliness</i>

00:23:53.083 --> 00:23:58.167
<i>I thank you now</i>

00:24:06.875 --> 00:24:07.958
"Next Episode"

00:24:10.958 --> 00:24:13.500
"Dark Arts Chapter Tenth Night The Bodhisattva Eye"

00:24:13.500 --> 00:24:17.046
"Tokyo Majin"
"Dark Arts Chapter Tenth Night The Bodhisattva Eye"
